<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $750,000 Lyon Grand Prix men's indoor tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 7-6 (7-2) 6-7 (5-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 4-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-3 1-6 6-1</p>
<p>Gianluca Pozzi (Italy) beat Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>Younes El Aynaoui (Morocco) beat 3-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) 5-7 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Lionel Roux (France) beat Andrea Gaudenzi (Italy) 3-6 6-4 6-0  </p>
<p>4-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Alex Radulescu (Romania) 4-6 6-4 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Andrei Chesnokov (Russia) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-2 6-1  </p>
<p>8-Michael Stich (Germany) beat Jakob Hlasek (Switzerland) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3  </p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Guy Forget (France) 6-4 6-2  </p>
<p>Jan Siemerink (Netherlands) beat 6-Cedric Pioline (France) 7-6 (7-4) 7-5 (Ends results)</p>
</text>
